                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>British Prime Minister Churchill and Foreign Secretary Eden traveled to Paris in
                    mid-December for meetings with French Government officials. For a report on
                    these meetings, see telegram 3663 from Paris, Document 457.</p>
            </div>
